# T-22 仓库级换行与二进制规则：跨平台协作时行尾由 Git 统一裁决
# 默认：所有文本文件入库 LF，检出行尾按平台（Windows 为 CRLF）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本必须 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Shell 与类 Unix 脚本必须 LF
*.sh text eol=lf
mvnw text eol=lf
mvnw.cmd text eol=crlf

# Web/配置文本统一 LF（显式声明，防止 auto 误判）
*.java text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.js text
*.jsx text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.xml text
*.html text
*.css text
*.scss text
*.sql text
*.md text
*.properties text
*.csv text

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.jar binary
*.class binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.p12 binary
*.jks binary
*.rdb binary
